ined concurrency such as --max-num-seqs 1 and small max model length, wait for /v1/models readiness, record /v1/models, /metrics, minimal /v1/chat/completions, and /metrics while at least one request is in flight or queued where feasible. Replay mode must be the default CI path and parse cassette data only. Out of scope: llama-server cassettes, route scoring, sticky leases, and hand-written HTTP mocks.\n    \u003c/description\u003e\n    \u003cacceptance\u003e\n1. go test ./internal/provider/vllm ./... -run \u0026#39;VLLM.*Cassette|VLLM.*Utilization\u0026#39; passes in replay mode using committed cassettes. 2. FIZEAU_RECORD_PROVIDER_CASSETTES=1 go test ./internal/provider/vllm -run \u0026#39;Record\u0026#39; installs or starts vLLM itself and refreshes cassettes without requiring a manually pre-started server. 3. Cassettes include real /v1/models, /metrics, minimal chat, and under-load metrics interactions. 4. Replay parsing extracts vllm:num_requests_running, vllm:num_requests_waiting, and kv_cache_usage_perc or legacy gpu_cache_usage_perc. 5. No hand-written endpoint mocks define the provider contract.\n    \u003c/acceptance\u003e\n    \u003clabels\u003earea:provider, kind:test\u003c/labels\u003e\n    \u003cmetadata parent=\"fizeau-c58969b6\" spec-id=\"FEAT-003\" base-rev=\"6956571a8a5a79b1c79d95a0bdcd215a3cd6ab8a\" bundle=\".ddx/executions/20260506T015209-ea6a53cf\"/\u003e\n  \u003c/bead\u003e\n  \u003cgoverning\u003e\n    \u003cref id=\"FEAT-003\" path=\"docs/helix/01-frame/features/FEAT-003-providers.md\"\u003eFeature Specification: FEAT-003 — LLM Providers\u003c/ref\u003e\n  \u003c/governing\u003e\n\u003c/execute-bead\u003e\n","metadata":{"attempt_id":"20260506T015209-ea6a53cf","base_rev":"6956571a8a5a79b1c79d95a0bdcd215a3cd6ab8a","bead_id":"fizeau-8ca7a5b4","bundle_path":".ddx/executions/20260506T015209-ea6a53cf","correlation_id":"fizeau-8ca7a5b4:20260506T015209-ea6a53cf","prompt_file":".ddx/executions/20260506T015209-ea6a53cf/prompt.md","prompt_sha":"d9a3ff93